B.RQ=s(["Last spring, residents of Cedar House decided to turn their empty roof into a garden.","Before planting anything, they asked an engineer to check that the roof could support the extra weight.","Once the engineer approved the plan, they filled lightweight boxes with soil and planted herbs.","By the end of summer, the herbs were ready to share at a meal for everyone in the building."],t.s)
