B.Lr=new A.bg("l03",B.bZ,"A customer is speaking to a shop assistant.","What does the customer want?",B.Q8,2,null,B.A,"The customer says: I bought these shoes yesterday, but they are too small. The assistant replies: Would you like a refund? The customer says: No, I like the style. Do you have the same pair in a larger size?",B.bS)
B.Ti=s(["The time of day","The day of the week","The contents of the box"],t.s)
B.LQ=new A.bg("l04",B.bZ,"You hear a voicemail about a delivery.","What has changed about the delivery?",B.Ti,1,null,B.A,"Hello, this is Mina from Green Basket. Your vegetable box will arrive on Thursday this week instead of Wednesday because our van needs a repair. The delivery time will still be between nine and eleven in the morning.",B.bS)
B.R2=s(["A portable screen","Some paint","Extra chairs"],t.s)
B.LH=new A.bg("l05",B.bZ,"Two colleagues are discussing a meeting.","What will Priya bring?",B.R2,0,null,B.A,"Priya says: Can we use the large meeting room this afternoon? Tom replies: It is being painted. I have booked the small room upstairs, but we will need to borrow a screen. Priya says: I can bring the portable one from my office.",B.bS)
B.SB=s(["It is the shortest route","The viewpoint has moved","The cliff path is under repair"],t.s)
B.Lk=new A.bg("l06",B.bZ,"A guide is talking to visitors.","Why will the group use the woodland trail?",B.SB,2,null,B.A,"Welcome to the island nature reserve. The cliff path is closed while the steps are repaired, so our walk will follow the woodland trail. We will still reach the viewpoint, but please allow an extra twenty minutes for the return journey.",B.bS)
B.Sz=s(["Collecting twenty more interviews","Grouping the existing comments by theme","Writing the final conclusion immediately"],t.s)
B.Li=new A.bg("l07",B.bZ,"A student is discussing a project with a tutor.","What does the tutor recommend doing next?",B.Sz,1,null,B.A,"The student says: I have collected twenty interviews, but I am not sure how to organise the findings. The tutor replies: Do not add more interviews yet. First, group the comments by theme. That will help you see which ideas appear most often.",B.bS)
B.Rt=s(["Using venues that provide space for free","Reducing the number of events","Increasing ticket prices"],t.s)
B.LF=new A.bg("l08",B.bZ,"You hear a radio update about a town festival.","How are the organisers responding to the smaller budget?",B.Rt,0,null,B.A,"Organisers say this year\u2019s festival will go ahead despite a smaller budget. Rather than cutting the number of events, they have asked local venues to donate space. Ticket prices will remain unchanged, and any surplus will help fund next year\u2019s programme.",B.bS)
B.QW=s(["She is opposed to every part of it","She no longer has any questions","She is more positive but still has a concern"],t.s)
B.Ly=new A.bg("l09",B.bZ,"Two neighbours are talking about a building proposal.","How does Anna feel about the revised proposal?",B.QW,2,null,B.A,"Anna says: I expected the new community centre to make the street noisier. David replies: So did I, but the revised design puts the entrance on the main road and adds sound insulation. Anna says: That addresses my biggest concern. I would still like to see a clear parking plan.",B.bS)
B.Rz=s(["The colour customers prefer","Whether enough containers are returned","Whether deposits can be increased each week"],t.s)
B.LA=new A.bg("l10",B.bZ,"A manager is explaining a pilot scheme.","What will determine whether the scheme expands?",B.Rz,1,null,B.A,"We are introducing reusable containers in two branches for six weeks. Customers will pay a small deposit, which they get back when they return a container. We are not expanding the scheme yet. We first need to know whether enough containers come back to make cleaning and transport worthwhile.",B.bS)
